    {
      "id": "5e3fd52c-eaf2-5eb7-8da8-f080ae3dd303",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "훈련이 끝난 연습실. {name}{i} 땀을 닦고 있다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The practice room after training. {name} is wiping off sweat.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5e90edfc-45f6-5949-a353-d207b51d745b",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
      "content": "오늘 훈련 어땠어?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "How was training today?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a83cd92d-85d7-5feb-a4a4-947f2d796a77",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그럭저럭이요. 손은 좀 풀린 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "So-so. I think my hands loosened up a bit.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "189c933f-a372-58f4-b9be-6dbad149d927",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "오전 만남 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "5e3fd52c-eaf2-5eb7-8da8-f080ae3dd303"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "6a2f455f-0472-5416-af63-ce78c82d8434": "talk",
        "2516927f-a6b2-54d8-b868-35efb3319ba7": -1,
        "f863e6ac-b85f-5a6a-8142-a550ccc353a3": 0,
        "df3f1458-aa1e-509b-9aba-e34e0e90b243": "",
        "3ec64c44-fe70-5623-92a0-b11ec647c973": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eb6750f6-f7bb-5a8d-8c54-5e8c7385786c",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "3d6c7745-70ae-527d-85ef-0a7f935e861a",
          "text": "그 정도면 충분해. 오늘은 푹 쉬어.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "8a148990-aeb3-5371-8cfd-af11ff1ea9be": "trust:+2;stress:-3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5dacc8de-5304-5ec0-a136-8a65da2ebdd1",
          "text": "내일은 조금 더 몰아붙여 보자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "8a148990-aeb3-5371-8cfd-af11ff1ea9be": "ok>trust:+3;ok>pmod:all:+1:-1;ng>stress:+4"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:3d6c7745-70ae-527d-85ef-0a7f935e861a": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "That's enough. Get some proper rest today.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:5dacc8de-5304-5ec0-a136-8a65da2ebdd1": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's push a little harder tomorrow.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "981dc6b8-d911-51e9-88d6-641ec05c8207",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -90,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네, 감사합니다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay, thank you.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ab39dac5-3cf4-5765-a171-f296a8715c2f",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "좋아요. 저도 그렇게 생각했어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Sounds good. I was thinking the same.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "f7ef6989-b9e2-5ff3-a4dd-2372bcefd045": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6d2be166-0c7a-582a-a648-91d66111d3a4",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…네. 해 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...Okay. I'll try.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "f7ef6989-b9e2-5ff3-a4dd-2372bcefd045": "ng"
      }
